stema de vigilancia por câmeras\n- Guarita com segurança na rua\n\n-Distância:\n- 2,6 km do Shopping Barigui \n- 3,8 km do Parque Barigui\n- 2,6 km do Pátio Batel\n- 1,5 km do Colégio Bom Jesus Seminário\n- 1,6 km Supermercado Condor\n- 1,2km Bar Distrito 1340\n\nAgende já a sua visita e surpreenda-se com este refúgio urbano.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/697bed0933086fd12dcb1699/pilar-homes-images-watermark/f07da727-69b2-47c8-979e-8d8cc2bbb8a6.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/697bed0933086fd12dcb1699/pilar-homes-images-watermark/da158bb1-3851-41bf-a08b-2e235cc8a9d3.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/697bed0933086fd12dcb1699/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b4a54f2b-6350-40bb-ad41-498e5b7fc7a4.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/697bed0933086fd12dcb1699/pilar-homes-images-watermark/a31e3d34-b0e6-424d-bfd0-73d826c11b3f.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/697bed0933086fd12dcb1699/pilar-homes-images-watermark/47af568c-8cb2-4edb-8f11-5d9fc3417d9c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/697bed0933086fd12dcb1699/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b46065eb-1510-4e98-9a4c-e42a34e97c51.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/697bed0933086fd12dcb1699/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b1e060fc-a7dd-444a-adee-028d5fa7d3e7.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/697bed0933086fd12dcb1699/pilar-homes-images-watermark/d816e7ac-2d0b-422c-9cbe-3ea28e211af1.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/697bed0933086fd12dcb1699/pilar-homes-images-watermark/c2a35105-3233-4954-8719-47b144649c1f.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/697bed0933086fd12dcb1699/pilar-homes-images-watermark/c861b276-dff5-42cf-972e-7af05eb6bd12.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/697bed0933086fd12dcb1699/pilar-homes-images-watermark/49d7e477-4f8e-4d01-bf02-9ec2e31dfdfe.jpeg","https://blintz-propert